---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Sovereign Agents</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      Your AI.<br>
      Your rules.<br>
      Your sovereignty.
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">
      Proactive AI agents that run inside confidential computing enclaves
      and use confidential inference for their LLM backend — so no one, not even
      the model provider, can see your data.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn-primary">How it works</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/sovereign-agents" target="_blank" class="btn-ghost">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 42rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #D4C5A9;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #F5F5F5;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #8A8A8E;
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    background: #F5F5F5;
    color: #09090B;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.88; }

  .btn-ghost {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    background: transparent;
    color: #8A8A8E;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 1px solid #222225;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { color: #F5F5F5; border-color: #444; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero { padding: 4rem 1.25rem; }
    .hero-subtitle { font-size: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
